w<br> Vacant and Ready to Move In<br> Open-Plan Living and Dining Area<br> Floor-to-Ceiling Windows<br> Fully Fitted Kitchen with Built-in Appliances<br> Premium Contemporary Finishes<br> Bright and Spacious Layout<br> Community Amenities:<br> Resort-Style Swimming Pool<br> Children's Pool and Play Area<br> Fully Equipped Indoor and Outdoor Gym<br> Landscaped Gardens<br> BBQ Area<br> 24/7 Security<br> Concierge Services<br> Ample Community Parking<br> Just a 2-Minute Walk to Dubai Hills Mall<br> <br> With direct access to Al Khail Road, residents enjoy seamless connectivity to Downtown Dubai, Business Bay, Dubai Marina, Dubai International Airport, and other key destinations. Surrounded by Dubai Hills Park, King's College Hospital, leading schools, cafés, restaurants, and retail outlets, Parkside Views offers an exceptional lifestyle in one of Dubai's most sought-after master communities.<br> <br>Contact Provident Real Estate Broker LLC - Branch today for more information or to arrange a private viewing.","longitude":55.2455416,"negotiator_id":"308","negotiator_mapping":"sam.m@providentestate.com","parking":[],"price":105000,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"lettings","slug":"1-bedroom-apartment-to-rent-in-parkside-views-dubai-hills-estate-dubai","status":"To Let","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/ad1/ad194db11d11a1c66c0261b111f79387/WhatsApp-Image-2026_07_16-at-15.08.26.jpg","title":"1 bedroom apartment to rent","extra":{"views":"","cheques":"4","project":null,"bitrix_id":"1492334","furnished":"Unfurnished","permit_number":"71525256299","rental_period":"Yearly","current_status":"","furnishing_type":"Unfurnished","completion_status":"completed","property_condition":"","property_managed_by_us":""},"video_tour":[],"virtual_tour":[],"qr_code":null,"premium":0,"link_to_employee":{"id":"308","url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prov-email-signatures/Mohamad-Horani-PFB.png","name":"Mohamad Horani","email":"sam